    "text": "Let $F(N)$ be the maximal size of $A\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}$ such that no $a\\in A$ divides the sum of any distinct elements of $A\\backslash\\{a\\}$. Estimate $F(N)$. In particular, is it true that $ F(N) > N^{1/2-o(1)}? $ ",
